oks the donors  want to stay  anonymous instead authoring this  statement  give random people some extra money and  they donate to charities  give billionaires extra money and  they'll just store it with all the other  money that they'll never get around to  spending  it's not money i deserved so i'm just  sharing the luck  it's a really beautiful thing the  parents can't believe their luck  that someone would take this you know  this fortune that they had  and spread it around is you know it is  really amazing and  you know it just really is a testament  to the you know the  kind of community that we have here as  for our storyteller chris braeshaw  he hopes others will subscribe to this  kind of good  anyone can duplicate this experience  it's the kind of story that really does  have a happy ending  robin gill global news vancouver  and that is global national for this  wednesday i'm sophie louis tonight's  york canada is this elk in east bolton  quebec  there are beautiful places all over  canada please email us yours to viewers  at globalnational.com  thanks for watching rob and gil will be  here tomorrow
 

